# The ignore file of Dockerfile beside it (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore before the context's own). The
# image is built from the repository's root, so everything is left out but what it needs: the component's requirements
# and source, and the connector kit's package. No tests, no knovas.env, no secrets/, nothing else of the repository.
*
!KnovasPlatform/components/sync_component/requirements.txt
!KnovasPlatform/components/sync_component/src
!KnovasConnectorKit/pyproject.toml
!KnovasConnectorKit/README.md
!KnovasConnectorKit/src
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
